  <DataPropertyAssertion><DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="kt:description"/><NamedIndividual abbreviatedIRI="kt:suite-realization-fuzz"/><Literal>Reduced ABoxes of the realization fuzz campaign 2026-11-19 (random ABoxes with complex class assertions, inverse and complex role assertions, same and different individuals over SHOIQ/SRIQ TBoxes). Expected types from Openllet 2.6.5 where FaCT++ 1.6.3 agrees; HermiT 1.4.5 is not used for the expectations because it derives wrong types in some of these realizations. Fixed cases are guards, the open ones are known failures of kt:issue-realization-fuzz-missed-types.</Literal></DataPropertyAssertion>

