  <DataPropertyAssertion><DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="kt:description"/><NamedIndividual abbreviatedIRI="kt:rf-crash-same-nominal-all"/><Literal>r(a,b), SameIndividual(c,b) and a defined class R = all r-.{d}: the realization crashed twice, first when it created a reader for the representative cache although no cache data was fixed for the ontology, then in the trivial model merging check, which looked up the merging hash of a node with the negated individual id and dereferenced the hash of a node into which nothing was merged (fixed in 998a13ce and 78710bf3). No class but owl:Thing is entailed.</Literal></DataPropertyAssertion>
