  <DataPropertyAssertion><DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="kt:description"/><NamedIndividual abbreviatedIRI="kt:rf-exact-functional-different"/><Literal>f functional, f(x5,x0) (written as an inverse assertion), C2(x0), R4 = (=1 f.C2) and an unrelated DifferentIndividuals axiom that makes the consistency check build a completion graph: x5 is an instance of R4. The realizer accepted 'all f.not C2' for x5 by the links of x5 in the cached graph, which did not contain the neighbour x0 because the neighbour expansion from the backend cache was blocked (fixed in eeeef583).</Literal></DataPropertyAssertion>
